  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvioletmoon.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/vm0.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://patreon.com/vazkii\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/vm1.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/vazkiimods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/vm2.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/vm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/vm3.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h1>关于</h1>\n<p>Zeta 是一个用于模块化玩法模组的综合性基础依赖库。它基于原始的 Quark 模块系统重构而成，并作为 AutoRegLib 的继任者。</p>\n<p>由于尚未完全开发完成，文档暂时不可用。其他模组很快就能使用它，请持续关注此处更新。</p>\n<p>除非其他模组明确要求依赖，否则无需下载 Zeta，因为它本身不包含任何内容。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/support.png\" alt=\"\">\n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/vazkii\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/patreon.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.vazkii.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/store.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvioletmoon.org%252fcreeperhost\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/ch.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
